# Dependencies copied here by CMake (see usbipd_cache_dep_sources) are a build
# cache, not something to commit.
#
# Ignore the directories themselves, not their contents: a nested .gitignore
# (FTXUI ships one that ignores "*" and whitelists files back) would otherwise
# win over a "/FTXUI/*" rule, because a deeper .gitignore takes precedence.
# Git never descends into an excluded directory, so nested rules cannot apply.
/FTXUI/
/spdlog/
